  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/094fca22-e2aa-45cc-9f1a-984b998db4dc-image.png\"/>    </p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math> be mid point of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AP</mi></math><br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/cd96a97b-2226-403a-9181-4f1ee2350602-image.png\"/><br >Line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AP</mi><mi> </mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> lies in the plane</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mo> </mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi> </mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>     (using mid point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math>)</p><p>So required plane (containing line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math> & passing through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>) is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mtable><mtr></mtr><mtr></mtr><mtr></mtr></mtable><mo>∴</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
